== Definition ids: one space for both directions and both request roles (§4.1) vs per direction
arena (§3.4): shared 7 ids -> 3 bits on every run and collection section; per direction: up 2 bits, down runs 2 bits, collection index 1 bits
60 definitions: shared 60 ids -> 6 bits on every run and collection section; per direction: up 5 bits, down runs 6 bits, collection index 2 bits
